# Naming Conventions

## Folders and files

| Artifact | Pattern | Example |
|----------|---------|---------|
| Entity folder | PascalCase Portuguese Bling name | `src/Entities/PedidosVendas/` |
| Entity class file | `<Folder>.php` | `src/Entities/Contatos/Contatos.php` |
| Operation folder | PascalCase method name | `Schema/FindFinalCustomer/` |
| Response class | `<Operation>Response` | `FindResponse`, `GetBankSlipsResponse` |
| Nested payload | `<Operation>ResponseData<Suffix>` | `FindResponseDataEndereco` |
| Query class | `<Operation>Params` | `GetParams`, `DeleteManyParams` |
| Enum | PascalCase, file matches the type | `Enum/Situacao.php` |
| Shared variant folder | `@shared`, namespace `Shared` | `Schema/@shared/ContasPagarOcorrenciaUnicaDTO.php` |
| Test spec | `<Entity>Test.spec.php` | `__tests__/ContatosTest.spec.php` |
| Test fixture directory | kebab-case operation | `__tests__/find-final-customer/response.json` |

## PHP identifiers

| Kind | Convention | Example |
|------|------------|---------|
| Entity class | PascalCase resource name | `Contatos`, `Nfes`, `FormasDePagamentos` |
| Enum case | `SCREAMING_SNAKE` Portuguese | `ATIVO = 'A'`, `CONTRIBUINTE_ICMS = 1` |
| Method | English verb, camelCase | `get`, `find`, `changeSituation`, `postStock` |
| Path id parameter | Bling's camelCase id | `$idContato`, `$idCampoCustomizado` |
| Query property | Bling's Portuguese camelCase | `$dataInclusaoInicial`, `$idsContatos` |
| Facade getter | camelCase | `$bling->formasDePagamentos`, `$bling->naturezasDeOperacoes` |
| Endpoint | kebab-case path | `"campos-customizados"`, `"contas/receber"` |

## Method names

- `get` — collection or auxiliary listing.
- `find` — one resource by id.
- `create`, `update`, `delete`, `deleteMany`.
- Further names describe the Bling action: `changeSituation`, `download`, `send`, `cancel`, `getModules`, `findByModule`, `generateNfe`.

## Enum names

Enum type names are Portuguese PascalCase (`Situacao`, `Criterio`, `TipoPagamento`, `IndicadorIe`). Case names describe the value in Portuguese.

## Facade getters

The getter is the camelCase form of the entity folder name: folder `FormasDePagamentos` → `$bling->formasDePagamentos`. Document it with `@property FormasDePagamentos $formasDePagamentos`.
